            "type": "h1",
            "content": "2020 台北電影節 片頭動畫"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Title",
          "props": {
            "type": "h1",
            "content": "2020 Taipei Film Festival Opening Animation"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Text",
          "props": {
            "content": [
              "台北電影節是每年於台灣台北市舉辦的電影節，主要由兩大競賽單元「國際新導演競賽」與「臺北電影獎」以及觀摩單元所組成。",
              "2020 年台北電影節再度邀請知名設計師廖小子創作主視覺，由「純粹」此一概念出發，運用光線直來直往的傳達與接收，呈現創作者的直抒胸臆與觀眾觀影時的感官動員。",
              "片頭動畫由平面主視覺所延伸，透過 3D 動畫呈現更豐富的光影效果與金屬質感，觀影體驗猶如穿梭在三種感官之中，時而交替，時而重疊，最終由如快門般的出口看到全貌，也許觀者在觀影的同時於腦海錄製全新的影像。"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Text",
          "props": {
            "content": [
              "The Taipei Film Festival is held annually in Taipei, Taiwan. It consists of two competitive sections, the International New Talent Competition and the Taipei Film Awards, along with a showcase programme.",
              "For the 2020 edition, the festival again invited renowned designer Godkidlla to create the key visual. Starting from the idea of \"purity\", it uses the direct transmission and reception of light to express the filmmakers' candid voices and the audience's sensory engagement while watching.", "The opening animation extends the 2D key visual into 3D, bringing richer light, shadow and metallic textures. The viewing experience moves through three senses, sometimes alternating and sometimes overlapping, until the full picture is revealed through a shutter-like opening, as if viewers were recording new images in their minds as they watch."
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
